# armour/shared/pauldron_shard5_l: the great SHARD pauldron on the left shoulder (shard.5; FORGE-MANTLE, the envelope: PLAN "The envelope", STYLE_P2 29).
# knapped shards: two blade-like flakes leaning out over a faceted cop, the long one 3 px over it, the facets in
# hard planes; a lame below (KNAPPED, obsidian; the envelope's great size).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair); the side views the large
# size's width + 1, hanging lower. Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the lame's lip, N the seam under the cop, P the flakes and the facets.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-MANTLE gen56.py from shapes56.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
